I am curious as to what you are trying to do during the vertical retrace time.
You can't do any graphics, so the only things you might do are set up the
upcoming movement of things, scoring or some similar math equates.
If you have a single solid color line that has interrupts prior and after,
that is an area that can't display any graphics. If this line is on top or
bottom, you will just need to adjust your graphics "play" area accordingly.
This will reduce the already limited display area of your program.

Ken













